              <p>(b) प्रांत <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-015::q5-domain" data-origin-check="q5-domain">(−∞, ∞)</span>; मूल्यसंच <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-015::q5-range" data-origin-check="q5-range">(−∞, ∞)</span>.</p>
