              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167829685902-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829685902-1">(2, −2);</span>
              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167829685902-2" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829685902-2">m = (5/2)</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <p data-kind="original" class="source-answer-missing">स्रोतात या प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिलेले नाही. स्वतः सोडवा.</p>
