          <div id="fs-id1167836557400" class="problem">
            <p id="fs-id1167836557402">x-अक्षावरील छेदाचे x-मूल्य <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::q15-x-intercept" data-origin-check="q15-x-intercept">−4</span>; <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::q15-slope" data-origin-check="q15-slope">m = 3</span>.</p>
