              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167836575633-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167836575633-1">m = (5/3); (0, −6)</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="#fs-id1167836434018">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a>
            </p>
