              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167836526730-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167836526730-1">m = (4/5); (0, −(8/5))</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="#fs-id1167829741998">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a>
            </p>
