        <p id="fs-id1167836312931" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836312931" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-017" data-source-tag="para">पुढील प्रश्नांत उतार आणि y-अक्षावरील छेदबिंदू वापरून प्रत्येक समीकरणाच्या रेषेचा आलेख काढा.</p>
        <section id="fs-id1167836558639" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836558639" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-017" data-source-tag="exercise">
          <h4>प्रश्न 21</h4>
          <div id="fs-id1167836408213" class="problem">
            <p id="fs-id1167836408215">
              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167836408215-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167836408215-1">y = 2x + 3</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <p data-kind="original" class="source-answer-missing">स्रोतात या प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिलेले नाही. स्वतः सोडवा.</p>
        </section>
        <section id="fs-id1167836533072" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836533072" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-017" data-source-tag="exercise">
          <h4>प्रश्न 22</h4>
          <div id="fs-id1167832982331" class="problem">
            <p id="fs-id1167832982333">
              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167832982333-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167832982333-1">y = −x − 1</span>
