          <div id="fs-id1167825766095" class="problem">
            <p id="fs-id1167825766097">
              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-017::src-fs-id1167825766097-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167825766097-1">y = −3</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="#fs-id1167836597617">स्रोत-उत्तर पाहा</a>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div id="fs-id1167836597617" class="solution">
            <h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5>
            <p id="fs-id1167836597619">आडवी रेषा काढा.</p>
