        <p id="fs-id1167826092388" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167826092388" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-020" data-source-tag="para">
          <strong>फलनाचे मूल्य शोधा</strong>
        </p>
        <p id="fs-id1167833386365" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167833386365" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-020" data-source-tag="para">पुढील प्रश्नांत फलनाची ही मूल्ये काढा:</p>
        <p id="fs-id1167833386368" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167833386368" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-020" data-source-tag="para">ⓐ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833386368-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833386368-1">f(−2)</span> ⓑ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833386368-2" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833386368-2">f(3)</span> ⓒ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833386368-3" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833386368-3">f(a).</span>
        </p>
        <section id="fs-id1167833396868" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167833396868" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-020" data-source-tag="exercise">
          <h4>प्रश्न 14</h4>
          <div id="fs-id1167833396870" class="problem">
            <p id="fs-id1167833396872">
              <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833396872-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833396872-1">f(x) = 3x−4</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="#fs-id1167833309935">स्रोत-उत्तर पाहा</a>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div id="fs-id1167833309935" class="solution">
            <h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5>
            <p id="fs-id1167833309937">ⓐ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833309937-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833309937-1">f(−2) = −10</span> ⓑ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833309937-2" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833309937-2">f(3) = 5</span> ⓒ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167833309937-3" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833309937-3">f(a) = 3a−4</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="#fs-id1167833396870">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
