          <div id="fs-id1167832951156" class="solution">
            <h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5>
            <p id="fs-id1167829741589">ⓐ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167829741589-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829741589-1">f(−2) = 20</span> ⓑ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167829741589-2" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829741589-2">f(3) = 0</span> ⓒ <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-020::src-fs-id1167829741589-3" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829741589-3">f(a) = a²−5a+6</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="#fs-id1167829720102">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
