      <section id="fs-id1167836792032" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836792032" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-022" data-source-tag="exercise">
        <h4>प्रश्न 10</h4>
        <div id="fs-id1167829790514" class="problem">
          <p id="fs-id1167829790516">उतार <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-022::src-fs-id1167829790516-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829790516-1">−((3)/(4))</span> आणि <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-022::src-fs-id1167829790516-2" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829790516-2">y</span>-अक्षावरील छेदनबिंदू <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-022::src-fs-id1167829790516-3" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167829790516-3">(0,−2)</span>.</p>
        </div>
        <p data-kind="original" class="source-answer-missing">स्रोतात या प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिलेले नाही. स्वतः सोडवा.</p>
      </section>
      <section id="fs-id1167829614537" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167829614537" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-022" data-source-tag="exercise">
        <h4>प्रश्न 11</h4>
        <div id="fs-id1167829614539" class="problem">
          <p id="fs-id1167832925252">
            <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-022::src-fs-id1167832925252-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167832925252-1">m = 2,</span> बिंदू <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-022::src-fs-id1167832925252-2" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167832925252-2">(−3,−1)</span>.</p>
          <p>
            <a href="#fs-id1167829756405">स्रोत-उत्तर पाहा</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div id="fs-id1167829756405" class="solution">
          <h5>स्रोतातील उत्तर</h5>
          <p id="fs-id1167833138135">
            <span class="math" data-check="MR-BRIDGE-022::src-fs-id1167833138135-1" data-origin-check="src-fs-id1167833138135-1">y = 2x+5</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="#fs-id1167829614539">प्रश्नाकडे परत</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="fs-id1167836574822" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836574822" data-kind="translation" data-origin-unit="MR-BRIDGE-022" data-source-tag="exercise">
        <h4>प्रश्न 12</h4>
        <div id="fs-id1167836574824" class="problem">
